      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>It's just hard to see the \"value\" when you're looking at the reality of it. My family, my friends... they're all working so hard, and all I do is consume their energy and time. I feel like a weight around their necks. It's not even about being sad anymore, it's just the shame of being a constant problem for everyone.",
